ALGORITHMS

The solar-longitude series and the calendar arithmetic are from:

  Jean Meeus, "Astronomical Algorithms", 2nd edition, Willmann-Bell, 1998.
  Chapters 7 (Julian Day) and 25 (the Sun's position).

The implementation is ours and is covered by the licence above. The
mathematics is Meeus's and is not claimed.

The reflection geometry is standard meteor-scatter theory: a trail reflects
specularly where it is tangent to the ellipsoid having both stations as foci.
